# NER model binary — 110 MB. See docs/ner-pipeline.md for where to obtain it.
# NOTE: this file is currently STAGED in git (`git status` shows it as added). Committing
# a 110 MB binary bloats the repo permanently, since git history keeps every version.
# To unstage: git rm --cached app/src/main/assets/ner_model_quantized.tflite
app/src/main/assets/ner_model_quantized.tflite

# ObjectBox writes a .bak of the entity model on every regeneration.
# default.json itself MUST be committed — it holds the stable UIDs that let ObjectBox
# migrate existing databases. Losing it means every entity gets new UIDs and existing
# app data is dropped.
app/objectbox-models/*.json.bak
